.TH PATH_GETCWD 3
.SH NAME
path_getcwd, path_getcwd_s \- get current working directory
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "path_internal.h"
.PP
.B void path_getcwd(stralloc* sa);
.br
.B char* path_getcwd_s(void);
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B path_getcwd
retrieves the current working directory and stores it in the provided 
.B stralloc 
buffer.
.PP
.B path_getcwd_s
provides a non-reentrant alternative that returns a pointer to a static internal buffer containing the current working directory.
.SH RETURN VALUE
.B path_getcwd
has no return value. 
.B path_getcwd_s
returns a pointer to the directory string or NULL on failure.